Architecture plan for issue #106

Scope:
- Update the existing MyClawTeamCard in app/(public)/blog/[slug]/page.tsx.
- Move the card so it renders after the author aside instead of between the Markdown article body and author card.
- Replace the placeholder text mark with the issue-specified remote logo image.
- Replace the card copy and social links with the exact issue-provided content.

Module structure and file organization:
- Keep MyClawTeamCard colocated in app/(public)/blog/[slug]/page.tsx because it remains article-page-specific and uses only presentational markup.
- Do not introduce backend routes, schema changes, persistent state, auth, email, or object-storage behavior.
- Reuse existing editorial Tailwind classes and link styling patterns from the article page.

Dependencies between issues:
- Single issue in this batch. It corrects the card shipped by earlier article-page work and depends only on that component already existing.

Key design decisions:
- Use the exact remote logo path from the issue: https://myclawteam.ai/logo.png.
- External links should open in a new tab with rel="noreferrer".
- Preserve article content and author card behavior; only reorder the MyClawTeamCard below the author card.
